    <bpmn:process id="W_W3445" name="W3445. Customer Lifetime Value (CLV), Retention Economics &amp; Churn Prediction" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual/quarterly analytics; KAP (W3427)
Frequency: Quarterly
Volume: ~700 strategic accounts; full B2B base (~5,200)
Owner: CRM/Analytics Lead
Participants: CRM/Analytics (links to VS-13.3/VS-28.1), Merchandising Finance, Account Managers, Data Science (links to VS-30.2)
Source: workflow W3445 — Customer Lifetime Value (CLV), Retention Economics &amp; Churn Prediction</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3445_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3445_Lane1" name="CRM">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3445_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3445_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3445_Lane2" name="Data Science">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3445_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3445_Lane3" name="Account Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3445_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3445_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3445_Start5" name="Annual/quarterly analytics; KAP (W3427)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3445_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3445_Task6" name="CRM/Analytics compute Customer Lifetime Value (CLV) per strategic account…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: CRM/Analytics compute Customer Lifetime Value (CLV) per strategic account: historical margin (W3441), retention horizon, growth trajectory (W3433), cost-to-serve, and discount rate; segment accounts by CLV tier and identify high-value/at-risk
Responsible (R): CRM/Analytics / Finance
Accountable (A): Head of Strategic Accounts
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3445_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3445_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3445_Task7" name="Data Science/Analytics build/maintain churn-prediction and retention-economics…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Data Science/Analytics build/maintain churn-prediction and retention-economics models: behavioral signals (declining orders, CSAT drop links to VS-13.1, competitive activity links to VS-57), churn probability, retention cost vs CLV, and intervention ROI; refresh quarterly
Responsible (R): Data Science / Analytics
Accountable (A): Head of Strategic Accounts
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3445_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3445_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3445_Task8" name="Account Manager use CLV/churn insights to prioritize retention (W3446)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Account Manager use CLV/churn insights to prioritize retention (W3446), resource allocation (W3428), and growth investment (W3433); report CLV/churn trends to the portfolio review (W3443) and executives (links to VS-33.2)
Responsible (R): Account Manager / Analytics
Accountable (A): Head of Strategic Accounts
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3445_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3445_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3445_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
