        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-552 (ensure controlled execution — Account Profitability, Retention &amp; Strategic Analytics (PA-107.3).) | - operational: conservative assumptions and validation; operational: model refresh and early-warning
Owner: CRM/Analytics Lead</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
