    <bpmn:process id="W_W3446" name="W3446. At-Risk Account Identification, Save-Plan &amp; Win-Back" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: At-risk signal (W3445/W3443); customer complaint/escalation (links to VS-13.1); lost deal
Frequency: Continuous + event-driven
Volume: ~5–10% of strategic accounts at-risk at any time
Owner: Head of Strategic Accounts
Participants: Head of Strategic Accounts, Account Manager, Sponsor, CX (links to VS-13.1), Service (links to VS-12), Customer
Source: workflow W3446 — At-Risk Account Identification, Save-Plan &amp; Win-Back</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3446_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3446_Lane1" name="Account Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3446_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3446_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3446_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3446_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3446_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3446_Start3" name="At-risk signal (W3445/W3443); customer complaint/escalation (links to VS-13.1); lost deal">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3446_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3446_Task4" name="Account Manager/Analytics identify at-risk accounts from signals: declining…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Account Manager/Analytics identify at-risk accounts from signals: declining revenue/order, CSAT drop (links to VS-13.1/W65), complaint escalation (links to W469/W41), competitive displacement (links to VS-57), stakeholder turnover (W3429), credit-hold friction (W3444); classify root cause and severity
Responsible (R): Account Manager / Analytics
Accountable (A): Head of Strategic Accounts
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3446_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3446_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3446_Task5" name="Account Manager/Sponsor build and execute the save-plan: root-cause resolution…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Account Manager/Sponsor build and execute the save-plan: root-cause resolution (service issue links to VS-12/VS-90, pricing links to W3434, relationship links to W3429), executive intervention (W3438), concession within authority, and demonstrated recovery; track save-progress
Responsible (R): Account Manager / Sponsor
Accountable (A): Head of Strategic Accounts
Duration: Per account</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3446_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3446_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3446_Task6" name="For churned/lapsed accounts, Account Manager maintain the win-back plan…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: For churned/lapsed accounts, Account Manager maintain the win-back plan: periodic re-engagement, monitor trigger events (new project, competitor failure), and reactivate (links to VS-13.1 W84 reactivation); capture loss lessons (W3447) and feed to continuous improvement
Responsible (R): Account Manager
Accountable (A): Head of Strategic Accounts
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3446_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3446_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3446_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3446_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-87 (ensure key-account credit concentration &amp; ethics governance.) | - operational: early-warning analytics (W3445); operational: root-cause discipline and exec engagement
Owner: Head of Strategic Accounts</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
