    <bpmn:process id="W_W3448" name="W3448. KAM Program Performance, ROI &amp; Executive/Board Reporting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Quarterly/annual program review; board cycle (links to VS-36)
Frequency: Quarterly + annual
Volume: Full KAM program
Owner: Head of Strategic Accounts
Participants: Head of Strategic Accounts, Finance (links to VS-17.4), Head of Trade / Account Management, CFO, Board (links to VS-36)
Source: workflow W3448 — KAM Program Performance, ROI &amp; Executive/Board Reporting</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3448_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3448_Lane1" name="Head of Strategic Accounts">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3448_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3448_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3448_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3448_Lane2" name="CFO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3448_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3448_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3448_Start4" name="Quarterly/annual program review; board cycle (links to VS-36)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3448_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3448_Task5" name="Head of Strategic Accounts/Finance compile the KAM program performance view…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Head of Strategic Accounts/Finance compile the KAM program performance view: strategic-account revenue/GM$ and share of total, growth vs market, retention/churn (W3445), profitability (W3441), pipeline coverage (W3442), program cost (account teams W3428) and ROI, and strategic-account concentration risk (W3444)
Responsible (R): Head of Strategic Accounts / Finance
Accountable (A): Head of Trade / Account Management / CFO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3448_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3448_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3448_Task6" name="Head of Strategic Accounts/CFO evaluate program effectiveness vs objectives and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Head of Strategic Accounts/CFO evaluate program effectiveness vs objectives and strategy (links to VS-33): tier coverage adequacy, resource productivity, growth/retention outcome, and competitor position; recommend program adjustments (coverage, team model, incentives links to W228/VS-102.3)
Responsible (R): Head of Strategic Accounts / CFO
Accountable (A): COO / CEO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3448_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3448_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3448_Task7" name="CFO/Head of Strategic Accounts report KAM program performance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: CFO/Head of Strategic Accounts report KAM program performance, strategic-account concentration, and risk to the executive committee (links to VS-33.2) and Board (links to VS-36); ensure disclosure of material customer concentration in financial reporting (links to VS-17) and alignment with the revenue/margin narrative (links to VS-101.3)
Responsible (R): CFO / Head of Strategic Accounts
Accountable (A): Board / Audit Committee
Duration: Quarterly/Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3448_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3448_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3448_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3448_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-552 (ensure controlled execution — Account Profitability, Retention &amp; Strategic Analytics (PA-107.3).) | - operational: finance review and audit; operational: ROI analytics
Owner: Head of Strategic Accounts</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3448_Assoc10" sourceRef="W3448_Annotation9" targetRef="W3448_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
